  "location": "AUD Annex C(a)",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "AUD Annex C (Insurance Intermediary Auditor's Report) measures client money 'in accordance with COB 11', which has no client-money rules",
      "summary": "AUD Annex C (Insurance Intermediary Auditor's Report), paragraphs (a) and (b)(i), measure client money \"in accordance with COB 11\", while (b)(iii)-(iv) refer to COB 8. The client-money rules for insurance intermediaries were added to COB as section 8.5 in December 2018; COB 11 now ends at 11.7.7 and contains no client-money rules. The meaning can be recovered from (b)(iii)-(iv) and the title of the Annex.",
      "correction": "Please replace \"COB 11\" with \"COB 8.5\" in Annex C (an editorial correction under section 19(3)(a) of the AIFC Regulations on AIFC Acts)."
    }
  },
